  <p id="c-nanqishu-039-lucheng-wangjian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　<persName id="c-nanqishu-039-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0002" ref="77h_id3_a0i_AA">陸澄</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-039-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0005" ref="77h_id3_a0i_AA">彥淵</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-039-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0015" ref="77h_id3_a0i">邵</persName>，臨海太守。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-039-lucheng-wangjian:p001:m0023" ref="77h_id3_a0i_A">瑗</persName>，州從事。</p>
